      "description": "[macOS] Block clock_get_time in WebContent sandbox\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=305111\nrdar://167763966\n\nReviewed by Mike Wyrzykowski.\n\nIn <https://commits.webkit.org/302812@main>, we added this syscall to the sandbox. However, we would like to\nblock it on some macOS versions, since there exists a workaround. The syscall was already allowed on iOS, so\nwe can remove the duplicate entry there.\n\n* Source/WebKit/Shared/Sandbox/iOS/webcontent-defines.sb:\n* Source/WebKit/WebProcess/com.apple.WebProcess.sb.in:\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/305316@main",
