      "subject": "Unify sandbox rules for logging",
      "description": "Unify sandbox rules for logging\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=293528\nrdar://151960188\n\nReviewed by Brent Fulgham.\n\nWe should unify sandbox rules for logging between macOS and iOS by conditionalizing on the same\nentitlement. It's important to use an entitlement instead of a sandbox version check, because\nthe sandbox version is not set on process launch, but an entitlement is present from launch.\n\n* Source/WebKit/Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb.in:\n* Source/WebKit/Scripts/process-entitlements.sh:\n* Source/WebKit/Shared/Sandbox/common.sb:\n* Source/WebKit/WebProcess/com.apple.WebProcess.sb.in:\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/295394@main",
