      "subject": "Remove an unneeded IOKit property",
      "description": "Remove an unneeded IOKit property\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=236867\n<rdar://47695155>\n\nReviewed by Per Arne Vollan.\n\nThe relevant frameworks that used the IOPlatformUUID IOKit\nproperty have been updated to no longer refer to it. We can\nnow safely remove it.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb.in:\n* WebProcess/com.apple.WebProcess.sb.in:\n\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/247638@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@290316 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
