      "touches_mac_sb": false,
      "summary": "Remove redundant sandbox exception rules for registering mach extensions — The Sandbox implementation offers a mechanism for apps to extend their sandbox at compi...",
      "subject": "Remove redundant sandbox exception rules for registering mach extensions",
      "description": "Remove redundant sandbox exception rules for registering mach extensions\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=230909\n<rdar://problem/66583587>\n\nReviewed by Per Arne Vollan.\n\nThe Sandbox implementation offers a mechanism for apps to extend their sandbox at compile\ntime. WebKit does not use those extensions in its sandbox design, so we should remove those\nunused rules. They are left-over from importing the global App Sandbox rules long ago, and\nare not needed by WebKit.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.GPU.sb:\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.Networking.sb:\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb.in:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/242242@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@283195 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
