      "touches_mac_sb": true,
      "summary": "Extend Network Process sandbox to access more Network Extension databases — We don't allow the Network Process to directly memory-map files used by the network ex...",
      "subject": "[Cocoa] Extend Network Process sandbox to access more Network Extension databases",
      "description": "[Cocoa] Extend Network Process sandbox to access more Network Extension databases\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=225614\n<rdar://problem/77696566>\n\nReviewed by Per Arne Vollan.\n\nWe don't allow the Network Process to directly memory-map files used by the network extensions\nfeature. We can improve memory performance by allowing the process to mmap these files, rather\nthan forcing a series of XPC operations to build the same database in memory.\n\n* NetworkProcess/mac/com.apple.WebKit.NetworkProcess.sb.in:\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.Networking.sb:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/237570@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@277309 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
