      "summary": "Reduce logging for uninteresting sandbox violations (GPU sandbox)",
      "subject": "[iOS] Reduce logging for uninteresting sandbox violations",
      "description": "[iOS] Reduce logging for uninteresting sandbox violations\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=225197\n<rdar://problem/77321299>\n\nReviewed by Per Arne Vollan.\n\nCFPreferences needs to read from .GlobalPreferences.plist and .GlobalPreferences_m.plist on iOS, just like it\ndoes on macOS. We should unblock these so we stop getting useless telemetry about the violations, and avoid\npreference problems on iOS.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.GPU.sb:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/237165@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@276787 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
