      "sb_only": true,
      "touches_mac_sb": false,
      "summary": "Correct process-info rules to restrict to self — The sandbox allows 'process-info' by default, so our allow rules have no real impact",
      "subject": "[iOS] Correct process-info rules to restrict to self",
      "description": "[iOS] Correct process-info rules to restrict to self\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=224383\n<rdar://problem/66582454>\n\nReviewed by Eric Carlson.\n\nThe sandbox allows 'process-info' by default, so our allow rules have no real impact.\nWe need to deny access first, as we do on macOS, so that the allow rules have meaning.\n\nI reviewed the macOS sandbox, and made sure the iOS sandbox allows the same items.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/236360@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@275789 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
