      "description": "Unreviewed, reverting r270674.\n\nBroke web content rendering on iOS\n\nReverted changeset:\n\n\"[iOS] Remove access to the IOKIt class AGXDeviceUserClient in\nthe WebContent process\"\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=219733\nhttps://trac.webkit.org/changeset/270674\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/232402@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@270739 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
