      "subject": "Deny logs for benign fontservicesd daemon",
      "description": "Deny logs for benign fontservicesd daemon\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=219180\n\nPatch by Adam Mazander <mazander@apple.com> on 2020-11-29\nReviewed by Per Arne Vollan.\n\nAfter investigating denials of fontservicesd logs over several submissions\nand without any fallout we are removing logging.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb:\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/231943@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@270234 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
