      "summary": "Remove unused WebContent process sandbox syscall — After further testing we have determined that the syscall added in Bug 206260 is not always enabled",
      "subject": "Remove unused WebContent process sandbox syscall",
      "description": "Remove unused WebContent process sandbox syscall\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=212609\n<rdar://problem/63764590>\n\nReviewed by Per Arne Vollan.\n\nAfter further testing we have determined that the syscall added in\nBug 206260 is not always enabled. Check if the Sandbox recognizes\nthe rule before using it.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb:\n* WebProcess/com.apple.WebProcess.sb.in:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/225443@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@262396 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
