      "summary": "Deny mach lookup access to frontboard services in the WebContent process",
      "subject": "[iOS] Deny mach lookup access to frontboard services in the WebContent process",
      "description": "[iOS] Deny mach lookup access to frontboard services in the WebContent process\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=209604\n\nReviewed by Darin Adler.\n\nSource/WebKit:\n\nDeny mach lookup access to \"com.apple.frontboard.systemappservices\" in the WebContent process on iOS.\n\nTest: fast/sandbox/ios/sandbox-mach-lookup.html\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb:\n\nLayoutTests:\n\n* fast/sandbox/ios/sandbox-mach-lookup-expected.txt:\n* fast/sandbox/ios/sandbox-mach-lookup.html:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/222530@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@259052 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
