      "summary": "Remove logging for sysctl access to properties used by NSURLSession — Telemetry and logging indicate that two sysctl calls are needed by [NSURLSession sessionWith...",
      "subject": "[iOS] Remove logging for sysctl access to properties used by NSURLSession",
      "description": "[iOS] Remove logging for sysctl access to properties used by NSURLSession\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=208346\n<rdar://problem/59862967>\n\nReviewed by Alexey Proskuryakov.\n\nTelemetry and logging indicate that two sysctl calls are needed by [NSURLSession sessionWithConfiguration].\nWe no longer need to log these well understood uses.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.Networking.sb:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/221284@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@257615 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
