      "sb_only": true,
      "touches_mac_sb": false,
      "summary": "Add sandbox telemetry to mach lookup rules in the WebContent process — We have already added telemetry to many mach lookup rules, but some were missing telemetry",
      "subject": "[iOS] Add sandbox telemetry to mach lookup rules in the WebContent process",
      "description": "[iOS] Add sandbox telemetry to mach lookup rules in the WebContent process\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=205175\n\nReviewed by Brent Fulgham.\n\nWe have already added telemetry to many mach lookup rules, but some were missing telemetry.\n\nNo new tests, no behavior change.\n\n* Resources/SandboxProfiles/ios/com.apple.WebKit.WebContent.sb:\n\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/218378@main\ngit-svn-id: https://svn.webkit.org/repository/webkit/trunk@253454 268f45cc-cd09-0410-ab3c-d52691b4dbfc",
